        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana K43, Solid Brass Oval Shell Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis oval shaped cup pull cabinet handle is great for drawers, furniture, or cabinet doors. The Oval Cup Cabinet Handle has a total length of 3-1/2 inches and 3 inch center to center mounting. Available in 8 beautiful finishes. Each cabinet handle includes matching finish screws for easy installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-K43-size.gif?v=1704354777\" width=\"431\" height=\"180\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana K43 Cabinet Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-elongated-shell-cabinet-handle-deltana-k407\"><b>Enlongated Shell Cabinet Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-early-american-shell-cabinet-handle-deltana-shp29\"><b>Early American Shell Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana K43 Shell Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Centers: 3\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/K43.pdf?v=1704262158\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana K43 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose, the cabinet handle will still be <b>high quality solid brass</b>. \r\n</p>",
