                "title": "3-1/2 Inch Oval Cup Cabinet Handle | Deltana K43",
                "description": "Solid Brass Oval Shell Cabinet Handle, Deltana K43 - This oval shaped cup pull cabinet handle is great for drawers, furniture, or cabinet doors. The Oval Cup Cabinet Handle has a total length of 3-1/2 inches and 3 inch center to center mounting. Available in 9 beautiful finishes. Each cabinet handle includes matching finish screws for easy installation. Available in 8 beautiful finishes.",
